    {
      "id": "JK-B01",
      "kind": "notice",
      "overrides": "NTC-CLASS-VS-VEHICLE",
      "textKey": "blocker.jk.class_vs_vehicle",
      "condition": {
        "any": [
          { "has": [{ "fact": "requestedClasses" }, "MC50CC"] },
          { "has": [{ "fact": "requestedClasses" }, "MCWOG"] }
        ]
      },
      "output": {},
      "text": {
        "en": "Pick the class that matches your vehicle: a scooter above 50 cc is 'scooter without gears' (MCWOG); the 50 cc class covers only up to 50 cc. A wrong class means a new LL and another 30 days."
      },
      "refs": ["EC-05", "F-04"],
      "source": {
        "title": "Sarathi class picker (observed 2026-10-22); Delhi Transport class table",
        "url": "https://transport.delhi.gov.in/hi/node/3079"
      },
      "grade": "OBS",
      "checkedOn": "2026-10-22",
      "confidence": "high",
      "verified": true,
      "approvers": ["maker:rules-agent@2026-10-23"]
    },
    {
      "id": "JK-B02",
      "kind": "warning",
      "overrides": "BLK-ADDRESS-MISMATCH",
      "textKey": "blocker.jk.address_mismatch",
      "fixKey": "fix.jk.address_ask_at_counter",
      "condition": { "eq": [{ "fact": "aadhaarAddressMatches" }, false] },
      "output": { "recommendPath": "non_aadhaar" },
      "text": {
        "en": "Your Aadhaar address is not where you live. Apply with another address proof (non-Aadhaar path, one more RTO visit) or update Aadhaar and then use the contactless path. How J&K offices handle this is not known: ask at the counter and tell us what you were told."
      },
      "refs": ["EC-02"],
      "source": {
        "title": "TN STA contactless LL flow (PIN-based RTO assignment); J&K behaviour unknown",
        "url": "https://tnsta.gov.in/video/flow_LLNew2022_english.pdf"
      },
      "grade": "P-state",
      "checkedOn": "2026-10-22",
      "confidence": "low",
      "verified": false,
      "approvers": ["maker:rules-agent@2026-10-23"]
    },
    {
